{"seq":3,"slug":"lc0373-find-k-pairs-smallest-sums","title":"LeetCode 373 查找和最小的 K 对数字","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-heap-monotonic/lc0373-find-k-pairs-smallest-sums","wordCount":851,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-373-查找和最小的-k-对数字\">LeetCode 373 查找和最小的 K 对数字</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>给定两个以非递减顺序排列的整数数组 <code>nums1</code> 和 <code>nums2</code>，以及一个整数 <code>k</code>。定义一对值 <code>(u, v)</code>，其中第一个元素来自 <code>nums1</code>，第二个元素来自 <code>nums2</code>。</p>\n<p>请找到和最小的 <code>k</code> 个数对 <code>(u, v)</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= nums1.length, nums2.length &lt;= 10^5</code></li>\n<li><code>-10^9 &lt;= nums1[i], nums2[j] &lt;= 10^9</code></li>\n<li><code>nums1</code> 和 <code>nums2</code> 均按非递减顺序排列</li>\n<li><code>1 &lt;= k &lt;= min(nums1.length * nums2.length, 10^4)</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums1 = [1,7,11], nums2 = [2,4,6], k = 3&#10;输出：[[1,2],[1,4],[1,6]]&#10;解释：返回的前 3 对为：[1,2],[1,4],[1,6]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums1 = [1,7,11], nums2 = [2,4,6], k = 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[[1,2],[1,4],[1,6]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：返回的前 3 对为：[1,2],[1,4],[1,6]</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"输入：nums1 = [1,1,2], nums2 = [1,2,3], k = 2&#10;输出：[[1,1],[1,1]]&#10;解释：返回的前 2 对为：[1,1],[1,1]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>输入：nums1 = [1,1,2], nums2 = [1,2,3], k = 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>输出：[[1,1],[1,1]]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>解释：返回的前 2 对为：[1,1],[1,1]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>本题的关键在于如何避免枚举所有 <code>m × n</code> 个数对，利用数组的有序性进行高效搜索。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p><strong>暴力方法的问题</strong></p>\n<p>直接枚举所有数对并排序的时间复杂度为 O(mn log(mn))，当 <code>m</code> 和 <code>n</code> 较大时会超时。我们需要利用两个数组已排序的性质来优化。</p>\n<p><strong>小顶堆 + 多路归并</strong></p>\n<p>将问题转化为多路归并：对于 <code>nums1</code> 中的每个元素 <code>nums1[i]</code>，它与 <code>nums2</code> 中所有元素的配对 <code>(nums1[i], nums2[0]), (nums1[i], nums2[1]), ...</code> 构成一个有序序列。这样就有 <code>m</code> 个有序序列需要归并，取前 <code>k</code> 小即可。</p>\n<p>具体做法：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>初始时将每个有序序列的第一个元素放入小顶堆，即 <code>(nums1[i] + nums2[0], i, 0)</code> 对所有 <code>i</code></li>\n<li>每次从堆中弹出最小和的数对 <code>(sum, i, j)</code>，将其加入结果</li>\n<li>如果 <code>j + 1 &lt; nums2.length</code>，将 <code>(nums1[i] + nums2[j+1], i, j+1)</code> 放入堆</li>\n<li>重复直到收集到 <code>k</code> 个数对</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>优化：</strong> 初始化时不需要将所有 <code>m</code> 个序列头都入堆，只需要入堆 <code>min(m, k)</code> 个即可，因为最多只需要 <code>k</code> 个结果。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>暴力排序</td>\n<td>O(mn log(mn))</td>\n<td>O(mn)</td>\n<td>超时，不可接受</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小顶堆多路归并</td>\n<td>O(k log(min(m,k)))</td>\n<td>O(min(m,k))</td>\n<td>最优实用方案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二分搜索</td>\n<td>O((m+n) log(max-min))</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>理论可行但实现复杂</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function kSmallestPairs(nums1: number[], nums2: number[], k: number): number[][] {&#10;  const m = nums1.length;&#10;  const n = nums2.length;&#10;  const result: number[][] = [];&#10;&#10;  const heap: [number, number, number][] = [];&#10;&#10;  function siftUp(i: number): void {&#10;    while (i &gt; 0) {&#10;      const parent = (i - 1) &gt;&gt; 1;&#10;      if (heap[parent][0] &gt; heap[i][0]) {&#10;        [heap[parent], heap[i]] = [heap[i], heap[parent]];&#10;        i = parent;&#10;      } else break;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  function siftDown(i: number): void {&#10;    const size = heap.length;&#10;    while (2 * i + 1 &lt; size) {&#10;      let smallest = 2 * i + 1;&#10;      if (smallest + 1 &lt; size &amp;&amp; heap[smallest + 1][0] &lt; heap[smallest][0]) {&#10;        smallest++;&#10;      }&#10;      if (heap[i][0] &gt; heap[smallest][0]) {&#10;        [heap[i], heap[smallest]] = [heap[smallest], heap[i]];&#10;        i = smallest;&#10;      } else break;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  function push(val: [number, number, number]): void {&#10;    heap.push(val);&#10;    siftUp(heap.length - 1);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  function pop(): [number, number, number] {&#10;    const top = heap[0];&#10;    const last = heap.pop()!;&#10;    if (heap.length &gt; 0) {&#10;      heap[0] = last;&#10;      siftDown(0);&#10;    }&#10;    return top;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  const limit = Math.min(m, k);&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; limit; i++) {&#10;    push([nums1[i] + nums2[0], i, 0]);&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  while (result.length &lt; k &amp;&amp; heap.length &gt; 0) {&#10;    const [, i, j] = pop();&#10;    result.push([nums1[i], nums2[j]]);&#10;    if (j + 1 &lt; n) {&#10;      push([nums1[i] + nums2[j + 1], i, j + 1]);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return result;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> kSmallestPairs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">k</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[][] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> m</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums1.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums2.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[][] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> heap</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> siftUp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> parent</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (i </span><span style=