<span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(m, k);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> limit; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([nums1[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums2[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], i, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (result.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> k </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> heap.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">i</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">j</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> pop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([nums1[i], nums2[j]]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([nums1[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums2[j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], i, j </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个解法的核心思想是<strong>延迟展开</strong>。我们不需要一次性生成所有可能的数对，而是像 BFS 一样逐步展开最有潜力的候选项。每次从堆中取出当前最小和的数对后，只需要推进该行的列指针，生成下一个候选数对。</p>\n<p>这种多路归并的思想在很多问题中都有应用：合并 K 个有序链表（LC 23）、有序矩阵中第 K 小（LC 378）等。掌握这个模式后可以举一反三解决一类问题。</p>\n<p>初始化时的优化也很重要——由于只需要 <code>k</code> 个结果，初始入堆数量不需要超过 <code>k</code>。这在 <code>m</code> 远大于 <code>k</code> 时能显著减少堆操作次数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间</td>\n<td>O(k log(min(m, k)))</td>\n<td>最多执行 k 次堆操作，堆大小 ≤ min(m, k)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间</td>\n<td>O(min(m, k))</td>\n<td>堆的最大大小</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>时间复杂度推导：</strong> 初始化入堆 min(m, k) 个元素，每次操作 O(log(min(m, k)))。主循环执行 k 次，每次弹出一个元素并可能入堆一个新元素，单次操作 O(log(min(m, k)))。总计 O(k log(min(m, k)))。</p>\n<p><strong>空间复杂度说明：</strong> 堆中最多同时存在 min(m, k) 个元素。每个元素存储 <code>(sum, i, j)</code> 三元组，空间开销为 O(min(m, k))。结果数组的 O(k) 空间通常不计入额外空间。</p>\n<p><strong>与暴力方法对比：</strong> 当 k 远小于 m × n 时，本方法有巨大优势。例如 m = n = 10^5，k = 10^4 时，暴力方法需要 O(10^10) 级别的操作，而本方法只需约 O(10^4 × 17) ≈ 170000 次操作。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 373 查找和最小的 K 对数字","id":"leetcode-373-查找和最小的-k-对数字"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 347 前 K 个高频元素","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-heap-monotonic/lc0347-top-k-frequent-elements"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 378 有序矩阵中第 K 小的元素","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-heap-monotonic/lc0378-kth-smallest-in-sorted-matrix"}}